# Standard ignores — keep the build context small and reproducible.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage

**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Local-only files that shouldn't influence the image.
# (mise.toml IS copied — it's the source of truth for Node + pnpm versions
# inside the build container as well as locally.)
Makefile
README.md
LICENSE
docs/
TODOS.md
DESIGN.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Don't bake the gstack metadata directory if anyone ever stages it.
.gstack/
